<description>&lt;p&gt;U.S. Defense Secretary Pete Hegseth traveled to Caracas and signed a military cooperation agreement with the interim Venezuelan government, restoring joint security efforts and labeling Venezuela a compliant security partner. The United States also launched a Caribbean operation during which a marine died after falling overboard. Former oil minister Machado urged a more drastic overhaul of Venezuela's oil sector. The crisis continues with hyperinflation, food shortages, massive emigration and socioeconomic collapse. Two battle-related deaths occurred in 2007, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivgFBVV95cUxQaVlsN2FuNE82VGp2ZXBmTF9Odkk0OU5waE5qUGdMZnRRNjRtQlVWaTg4encxV1NiMU9FTWh4TnVLc09DN1dLOWlRRHczUDBsWjEzdk9vdzY2N0VldVlXdTBSQXBha3pfb3RrMDE4LUctbHE4eWxxbXRLVktPM28wZlZrNWpQcVM1WHF0bEl4MXdpdTZONVBsUzkwMGxmRHFPNTBiaFQ1UDNKSjVkd2JqVlRqclkzUWVPX09qUGxn?oc=5&quot;&gt;Le Monde.fr&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisgFBVV95cUxOM3VlUmtXdkJETU9WcE4tTVZzNGtzMFFxZ05LcG5IX1pwWkdhWjczSmlqUGt2UVpfUWx0SFhsVDJ4Q3pWX3k1Qjk5czZGRUlleEZEbTFkQ1p4QnpMLTc3YkpDVkotUThwbGo0Q3U3dmJlYVJISzBqNmd4Vlo3eWtCTGlZZHNKaWZSendTWkJVcWdSTzcxQjRpNHlVV2haUjA4cFg1U1E5Z2hDdEFnWWVWd1p3?oc=5&quot;&gt;Bloomberg.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;New Castle News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;ABC News - Breaking News, Latest News and Videos&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXkFVX3lxTFBhMmREYWN0V2VkSW1lVVR3YUpaUXRCMDA5VmsyMi1ZeFp6Rk15bGxoQXYtU3dRcXE5cmJqREg0MHJfQ0hGNnQydzNiWEtoRXlzaVp6b05DVFpKVVdYT2c?oc=5&quot;&gt;朝日新聞&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a h